#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Modern UI Revamp PR-C - Worker C (Theme Studio: layout templates +
versioning hardening + permissions). Combined app.js + styles.css transform.

app.js (17 replacements):
  TS-8 permissions: themePermissions on defaultRoles (Administrator=true,
    Sales Rep/Viewer=false) + ensureAdminData backfill, canManageThemes()
    helper, no-permission panel in themeStudioTab, action-level guards on
    themePublish / themeRollback / themeDeleteVersion.
  TS-7 versioning: themeDiffHtml(a,b) + Diff buttons/modal, themeAudit log
    + Audit log panel, scheduled publish (scheduledFor + due-check at the
    top of themeStudioTab with contrast gate + audit entry).
  TS-4 layout templates: DASHBOARD_TEMPLATES (Executive/Sales floor/
    Minimal) + "Start from template" row in dashboardsTab; Page Builder
    section style preset (card/plain/divided) in the section configSchema
    + pageSectionStyleClass() applied at render time in pageLiveNodeHtml.
    (Dashboard widget up/down ordering already exists - verified, no change.)

styles.css (1 appended section): .page-section-plain / .page-section-divided,
100% token-driven, lint-clean.

Every replacement asserts its anchor matches EXACTLY the expected count;
any mismatch fails loudly. Plain quotes in HTML attrs/template literals;
\\' escapes only in single-quoted JS strings.

Usage: run from the repo root. NOTE: the workflow must stage both files
(`git add app.js styles.css`) for the CSS changes to be committed.
"""
